          "text": "The team did some tests, including:\n- Blood tests\n- A urine test\n- An ultrasound scan of your tummy\n\nWhile you were in hospital you were not allowed to eat or drink. You were given fluids and an antibiotic (co-amoxiclav) through a drip.\n\nYou then had an operation to remove your appendix (laparoscopic appendicectomy). The appendix was inflamed but had not burst. The operation went without any problems."
